      "description": "Run with 10 iterations using `data/sharedcert-data.json`. Per iteration: PUT cert PEM, PUT key PEM, POST CryptoCertificate config object pointing at the cert (sharedcert:///), POST CryptoKey config object pointing at the key. The crypto objects live in the `default` domain since sharedcert is appliance-wide."
    },
    {
